---
import { Font } from "astro:assets";
import "../styles/global.css";

const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const prefix = baseUrl.endsWith("/") ? baseUrl : baseUrl + "/";
const title = "MOSAIC Visualizer";
---

<!doctype html>
<html class="bg-white" lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="description" content="MOSAIC: HDT (Hierarchical Depth Traversal) tokenization visualizer" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href={prefix + "favicon.svg"} />
    <Font
      cssVariable="--font-noto-sans"
      preload={[{ subset: "latin", style: "normal" }]}
    />
    <title>{title}</title>
  </head>
  <body class="font-(family-name:--font-noto-sans) text-zinc-800 m-0 p-0">

    <header class="text-center pt-12 pb-6 px-6">
      <a href={prefix} class="text-sm text-blue-500 hover:underline mb-4 inline-block">&larr; Back to paper</a>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-medium mt-2 mb-3 sm:text-4xl">HDT Visualizer</h1>
      <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed sm:text-lg">
        <strong>HDT</strong> — Hierarchical Depth Traversal — coarsens the molecular graph into communities and serializes the resulting hierarchy with a single depth-first walk, so cross-community edges become ordinary back-edges in the token stream.
      </p>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pb-16">
      <div class="panel-card">
        <video
          src={prefix + "demo_hdt.mp4"}
          autoplay
          loop
          muted
          playsinline
          preload="auto"
          controls
          aria-label="HDT hierarchical depth traversal — token-by-token autoregressive generation"
          class="hero-image"
        ></video>
        <div class="panel-caption">
          Watch HDT build a molecule token-by-token. Root → community partitions → atoms. Solid orange curves are intra-community graph edges; dashed orange curves are cross-community edges (still encoded as back-edges during the DFS, with no separate wiring section). Black arrows trace the DFS traversal order.
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="text-center pb-8 text-sm text-zinc-400">
      <a href={prefix} class="text-blue-500 hover:underline">MOSAIC</a> &mdash; Compositional Abstraction for Autoregressive Graph Generation
    </footer>

    <style>
      .panel-card {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        border-radius: 0.75rem;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .hero-image {
        width: 100%;
        display: block;
      }
      .panel-caption {
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;
        color: #4b5563;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.55;
        border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
      }
      @media (min-width: 640px) {
        .panel-caption {
          padding: 1.25rem 2rem 1.5rem;
          font-size: 1rem;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
